// `/learn` redirected to `/examples`, which has no page of its own — only
// `/examples/no-app-webxr`. That was invisible until 2026-09-16 because the
// root catch-all answered `/examples` with HTTP 200 and ~54KB of the industry
// portal, so the redirect appeared to work. With the catch-all gone, `/learn`
// would have redirected into a 404.
//
// It now points at `/docs`, the page that says where each thing is. Regenerate:
// pnpm --filter @holoscript/studio holo:build
@page {
  route: "/learn"
  redirect: "/docs"
}
